range drone level 0.105 0.15 the depth: a mellow tone at C2 and C3 whose pitch wavers slowly (lfo>pitch 0.12 at 0.2 Hz), as things do seen through water, flanged
range bed level 0.18 0.3 the underwater rumble, now texture: mostly its noise (sines 0.4), under the drone
range bed cutoff 0.3 0.6 how deep under the surface: the orb's radius lifts it toward the light
range surface level 0 0.3 the stream in the open: an accent, in with stir
range surface speed 0.8 1.4 bubble rate (keep-len stretch), the pen's speed
range root level 0 0.17 C4: a mellow tone through a resonant low-pass whose cutoff hops at random: a burble on the note
range root lfo_rate 4 14 how fast it hops: the pen's speed (flow)
range root lfo>cut 0.05 0.3 how far the cutoff hops: turbulent at coherence 0, still water at 1
range root flange_pos 0 1 the comb, parked by the orb's curl
range third level 0 0.148 E4
range fifth level 0 0.148 G4
range seventh level 0 0.119 Bb4
range droplets level 0 0.5 the stream's droplets as partials, sines only: grows with the machine
range droplets gather 0.2 1 pulled onto the chord as the ratios come in tune
bind stir drone level 0.15 0.105
bind orb.radius drone cutoff 0.4 0.6
bind stir bed level 0.3 0.18
bind orb.radius bed cutoff 0.3 0.6
bind stir surface level 0 0.3
bind orb.speed surface speed 0.8 1.4
bind orb.radius surface cutoff 0.55 1
bind tone.root root level 0 0.17
bind tone.third third level 0 0.148
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.148
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.119
bind coherence root lfo>cut 0.3 0.05
bind orb.speed root lfo_rate 4 14
bind fit root shimmer 0.4 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.45 0.62
bind orb.curl root flange_pos 0 1
bind coherence third lfo>cut 0.3 0.05
bind orb.speed third lfo_rate 4 14
bind fit third shimmer 0.4 0
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.45 0.62
bind orb.curl third flange_pos 0 1
bind coherence fifth lfo>cut 0.3 0.05
bind orb.speed fifth lfo_rate 4 14
bind fit fifth shimmer 0.4 0
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.45 0.62
bind orb.curl fifth flange_pos 0 1
bind coherence seventh lfo>cut 0.3 0.05
bind orb.speed seventh lfo_rate 4 14
bind fit seventh shimmer 0.4 0
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.45 0.62
bind orb.curl seventh flange_pos 0 1
bind stack droplets level 0 0.5
bind coherence droplets gather 0.2 1
bind radiance droplets reverb 0.4 0.9
note aqueous v2 (2026-10-03): the voltaic / cryic move applied to water. (v1 made its notes by band-passing the stream recording, and aqueous_mystic bent its time; both are in git history.)
note What says water in a synth: a resonant low-pass whose cutoff jumps at random several times a second (sample-and-hold) over a steady tone. The filter picks out
note one harmonic after another, which the ear hears as bubbling. Here that is each chord tone: the note is exact, the burble rides on it.
note in tune = the water stills: the hops shrink (lfo>cut 0.3 -> 0.05 with coherence) until the notes are smooth; fit steadies their pitch; the droplets gather onto the chord.
note orb = flow: the pen's speed sets how fast the burble hops (4 to 14 a second) and the stream's rate, its radius opens the filters, its curl parks the combs.
note The recordings are accents now: the rumble (mostly noise) under a wavering drone, the stream on stir, the droplets as the reward, splashes and drips as one-shots.

