note Frost (tier II): the spell that turns an aqueous crystal cryic, so at the lock the water becomes the cryic palette: cryic's glass drone (ice) comes up at C3,
note the droplets stop (speed 0.02) and ring as glass on a harmonic-seventh chord, cryic's ice crackle follows the pen, the surface slows to half speed and the
note bed all but goes. Freezing splash on lock, the swish-whip crack on unlock. Root and SEVENTH: the interval no other aqueous spell has.

